stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> observing
  observing --> observing: ambient context
  observing --> processing: authorized mention
  processing --> waiting: needs a choice
  processing --> observing: reply or task
  waiting --> observing: requester chooses
  waiting --> processing: another authorized request
  observing --> disabled: remove group
  processing --> disabled: remove group
  waiting --> disabled: remove group
  disabled --> [*]
  note right of waiting
    Choices belong to their requester.
    Group tasks are shared by authorized members.
    Private memory never enters a group scope.
  end note
